erá","sep":"","error":"mismatch"}]]},{"number":"3","text":["kabe hena kṛpā    labhiyā e jana","    kṛtārtha ha-ibe, nātha!","śakti-buddhi-hīna    āmi ati dīna","    kara more ātma-sātha"],"word_by_word":["**kabe** — ¿cuándo?; **hena** — tal; **kṛpā** — misericordia; **labhiyā** — obtener; **e** — esta; **jana** — persona; **kṛtārtha** — cumplido; **ha-ibe** — será; **nātha!** — ¡oh maestro!; **śakti** — fuerza; **buddhi** — e inteligencia; **hīna** — desprovisto; **ami** — yo; **ati** — mucho; **dīna** — angustiado; **kara’** — por favor hazlo; **more** — a mí; **ātma** — el ser; **sātha** — con."],"translation":["¡Oh, mi Señor! ¿Cuándo esa misericordia recaerá en esta persona? Soy débil, desvalido y desprovisto de inteligencia. Por favor, permíteme estar contigo."],"isLong":false,"isWbwInlineModeAvailable":false,"inline_word_by_word":[[{"text":"kabe","trans":"¿cuándo?","sep":" "},{"text":"hena","trans":"tal","sep":" "},{"text":"kṛpā","trans":"misericordia","sep":"    "},{"text":"labhiyā","trans":"obtener","sep":" "},{"text":"e","trans":"esta","sep":" "},{"text":"jana","trans":"persona","sep":""}],[{"text":"kṛtārtha","trans":"cumplido","sep":" "},{"text":"ha-ibe","trans":"será","sep":", ","error":"multi"},{"text":"nātha","trans":"¡oh maestro!","sep":"!"}],[{"text":"śakti","trans":"fuerza","sep":"-"},{"text":"buddhi","trans":"e inteligencia","sep":"-"},{"text":"hīna","trans":"desprovisto","sep":"    "},{"text":"āmi","trans":"yo","sep":" ","error":"mismatch"},{"text":"ati","trans":"mucho","sep":" "},{"text":"dīna","trans":"angustiado","sep":""}],[{"text":"kara","trans":"por favor hazlo","sep":" "},{"text":"more","trans":"a mí","sep":" "},{"text":"ātma","trans":"el ser","sep":"-"},{"text":"sātha","trans":"con","sep":""}]]},{"number":"4","text":["yogyatā-vichāre    kichhu nāhi pāi","    tomāra karuṇā-sāra","karuṇā nā ha-ile    kā̐diyā kā̐diyā","    prāṇa nā rākhiba āra"],"word_by_word":["**yogyatā** — aptitud; **vichāre** — al considerar; **kichhu** — cualquier cosa; **nāhi** — no; **pāi** — obtengo; **tomara** — tuya; **karuṇā** — misericordia; **sāra** — la esencia; **karuṇā** — misericordioso; **nā** — no; **haile** — si eres; **kā̐diyā** — llorando; **kā̐diyā** — y llorando; **prāṇa** — vida; **nā** — no; **rākhiba** — mantendré; **āra** — nunca más."],"translation":["Si me examinas, no encontrarás cualidades. Tu misericordia lo es todo para mí. Si tú no eres misericordioso conmigo, tan solo podré llorar y no podré mantener mi vida."],"isLong":false,"isWbwInlineModeAvailable":false,"inline_word_by_word":[[{"text":"yogyatā","trans":"aptitud","sep":"-"},{"text":"vichāre","trans":"al considerar","sep":"    "},{"text":"kichhu","trans":"cualquier cosa","sep":" "},{"text":"nāhi","trans":"no","sep":" "},{"text":"pāi","trans":"obtengo","sep":""}],[{"text":"tomāra","trans":"tuya","sep":" ","error":"mismatch"},{"text":"karuṇā","trans":"misericordia","sep":"-"},{"text":"sāra","trans":"la esencia","sep":""}],[{"text":"karuṇā","trans":"misericordioso","sep":" "},{"text":"nā","trans":"no","sep":" "},{"text":"ha","trans":"si eres","sep":"-","error":"mismatch"},{"text":"ile","trans":"llorando","sep":"    ","error":"mismatch"},{"text":"kā̐diyā","trans":"y llorando","sep":" "},{"text":"kā̐diyā","trans":"vida","sep":"","error":"mismatch"}],[{"text":"prāṇa","trans":"no","sep":" ","error":"mismatch"},{"text":"nā","trans":"mantendré","sep":" ","error":"mismatch"},{"text":"rākhiba","trans":"nunca más","sep":" ","error":"mismatch"},{"text":"āra","trans":"-","sep":"","error":"mismatch"}]]}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.R. Sridhar Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/sridhar-maharaj-and-govinda-6","personSlug":"srila-b-r-sridhar-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-gurudev-kripa","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Nabadwip temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimahar